  - question: Can asthma be cured?
    answer: >-
      There is no cure, but good treatment means most people have few or no
      symptoms. Some children find their asthma gets better or goes away as
      they grow up, but it can come back later.
  - question: What is an asthma action plan?
    answer: >-
      It is a written plan you make with your GP or asthma nurse. It tells
      you which medicines to take every day, how to spot when your asthma is
      getting worse, and exactly what to do in an asthma attack.
